      <p class="article-intro">WhatsApp Channels have become one of the fastest-growing organic broadcast mediums in the world. Whether you are a brand, content creator, or e-commerce merchant, here is how to find, share, and supercharge your WhatsApp Channel link to gain thousands of active followers.</p>
