      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3>Why is my WhatsApp Channel link not working or opening a blank page?</h3>
      <p>Ensure the recipient has the latest version of WhatsApp installed. If clicked on a desktop browser without WhatsApp Web open, it will prompt them to download WhatsApp or launch the web app. Verify that your channel has not been deleted or restricted by Meta for community guideline violations.</p>

      <h3>Can I track how many clicks my WhatsApp Channel link gets?</h3>
      <p>WhatsApp natively tracks how many followers view or react to channel posts, but does not provide external click tracking for the link itself. To track clicks from your Instagram ads or social profiles, wrap your link with a shortener or UTM campaign builder before sharing.</p>

      <h3>Can I transfer admin ownership of a WhatsApp Channel?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Channel owners can invite other WhatsApp users to become admins under <em>Channel Info → Channel Settings → Invite Admins</em>. Multiple admins can post updates simultaneously.</p>

      <h3>How do I monetize my WhatsApp Channel?</h3>
      <p>You can monetize by sharing affiliate links, promoting sponsored brand collaborations, launching digital products, or routing followers to your WhatsApp business catalog for direct sales inquiries.</p>

